{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Endor Awakens: Roguelite DRPG",
    "steam_appid": 3594170,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endor Awakens</strong> is a thrilling evolution of Depths of Endor, a <strong>Roguelite</strong> <strong>DRPG</strong> where chaos reigns in the changing world after the fall of Mordoth. In this <strong>Dungeon Crawler</strong>, you'll venture through procedurally generated dungeons, encountering new challenges and treasures with every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city has transformed with new features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop</strong>: Buy weapons and armor to prepare for your adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inn</strong>: Meet new NPCs, take on common quests, and delve into the main story and side adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guilds</strong>: Unlock skills via a new skill tree and customize your character to match your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bestiary</strong>: Track the monsters you've faced and defeated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bank</strong>: Store items you don't need for later use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Chest</strong>: Log in every day for rewards and bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Morgue</strong>: Resurrect fallen heroes and continue your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your characters by choosing their race, gender, guild, and portrait. Hardcore mode adds extra challenge: if your character dies, there's no coming back. Pick a custom avatar from your device's gallery to make your hero truly unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based combat</strong> allows you to strategize every move, whether it's attacking, casting spells, using items, or defending. Beware of traps and events as you explore the depths of dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endor Awakens offers endless possibilities for adventure, as you forge your path through this ever-changing world. Your choices shape your journey, with each dungeon and character offering new opportunities. Will you rise to defeat the chaos, or succumb to the darkness of the depths? The fate of Endor lies in your hands.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endor Awakens</strong> is a thrilling evolution of Depths of Endor, a <strong>Roguelite</strong> <strong>DRPG</strong> where chaos reigns in the changing world after the fall of Mordoth. In this <strong>Dungeon Crawler</strong>, you'll venture through procedurally generated dungeons, encountering new challenges and treasures with every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city has transformed with new features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop</strong>: Buy weapons and armor to prepare for your adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inn</strong>: Meet new NPCs, take on common quests, and delve into the main story and side adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guilds</strong>: Unlock skills via a new skill tree and customize your character to match your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bestiary</strong>: Track the monsters you've faced and defeated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bank</strong>: Store items you don't need for later use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Chest</strong>: Log in every day for rewards and bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Morgue</strong>: Resurrect fallen heroes and continue your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your characters by choosing their race, gender, guild, and portrait. Hardcore mode adds extra challenge: if your character dies, there's no coming back. Pick a custom avatar from your device's gallery to make your hero truly unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based combat</strong> allows you to strategize every move, whether it's attacking, casting spells, using items, or defending. Beware of traps and events as you explore the depths of dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endor Awakens offers endless possibilities for adventure, as you forge your path through this ever-changing world. Your choices shape your journey, with each dungeon and character offering new opportunities. Will you rise to defeat the chaos, or succumb to the darkness of the depths? The fate of Endor lies in your hands.</p>",
    "short_description": "Explore procedurally generated dungeons in this roguelite dungeon crawler. Battle epic monsters, collect loot, and customize your character in strategic turn-based combat. Adapt to a constantly changing world after the fall of Mordoth.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cUn Rogue de manual, bien vitaminado de mec\u00e1nicas y una buena cantidad de contenido. Un free to play respetuoso con el jugador y una monetizaci\u00f3n justa. Los amantes del g\u00e9nero, en su forma m\u00e1s pura, ten\u00e9is aqu\u00ed una propuesta de lo m\u00e1s atractiva.\u201d<br>DeVuego<br>",
